+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Add optional private quote-send phase timings for queue waits, protocol calls, saved receipts, authorization storage and final send-state commits. Diagnostics use a bounded background writer, report missing context and dropped records, and do not change transport, retries or recovery. Server acceptance remains separate from recipient delivery.
